---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Image Identifier — a free browser tool for reviewing authenticity signals in image files."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-fg m-0">About</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Image Identifier helps you review authenticity <em>signals</em> available in an image file you
      select. The goal is clear evidence and honest limits — not a fake “real or fake” stamp.
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Analysis runs in your browser for the file you choose. The site may still download app assets
      and, if you opt in, an optional model for a statistical check.
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Read the <a href="/guides/">guides</a> for how to interpret results, or open the
      <a href="/">tool</a> to try a file.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-muted">
      <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
      <span class="mx-2">·</span>
      <a href="/">Back to the tool</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
